{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 对动机和转折的因果交代不如 Y 充分，尤其 S03 念头为何淡去、S10 为何决定不再追问，需要观众自行补足。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的加亮词能让观众迅速抓住每段情绪和叙事落点，感受文字也比较克制，能留出听音乐和体会画面的空间。Y 的优势是把人物动机、心理转折和前后呼应解释得更完整，但部分右侧短词堆叠重复，个别措辞还把细腻的亲近感推得过于浓烈。作为边听边扫的普通观众，我更愿意选择 X：它传达得更轻巧，情绪也更有余韵。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e907201c-5db4-4126-a186-8200187d349f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T021558812510Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:16:41.477287+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4c42118ebb8cb3f70ab9b1af243ce49955d49c01d9cb709fee5b99bbcdd557f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2